  "question": {
    "text": "A small spherical ball (obeying Stoke's law for viscous force) is thrown up vertically with a speed <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> and is received back by the thrower at the point of projection with a speed <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>. Neglecting the buoyant force on the ball, assuming the speed of the ball during its flight to be never equal to its terminal speed and taking the acceleration due to gravity&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>,&nbsp;find the time of flight of the ball in seconds.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "3",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">g</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">v</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">d</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">v</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">t</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">g</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8594;</mo></mover><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8201;</mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">m</mi></mfrac><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8201;</mtext><mover><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">v</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8594;</mo></mover><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8201;</mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8201;</mtext><mover><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">v</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8594;</mo></mover></math></p><p>Integrating both sides</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></msubsup><mover><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">g</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8594;</mo></mover><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">m</mi></mfrac><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></msubsup><mover><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">v</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8594;</mo></mover><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></msubsup><mi>d</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">v</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8594;</mo></mover></math></p><p>The total displacement of the ball in time&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi></math>&nbsp;is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></msubsup><mover><mi>v</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8594;</mo></mover><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">g</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8594;</mo></mover><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">u</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8594;</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>u</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>u</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>u</mi></mrow><mi>g</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math></p>",
